<http://www.semanticweb.org/mehme/ontologies/2026/superlig> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/mehme/ontologies/2026/superlig> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <http://www.semanticweb.org/mehme/ontologies/2026/superlig/2.0> .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/mehme/ontologies/2026/superlig> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An OWL 2 ontology representing the Turkish Süper Lig professional football league. Includes all 19 current teams, players, managers, stadiums, cities, playing positions, matches and seasons. Developed in Protégé 5.x using the METHONTOLOGY methodology. Phase 2 — May 2026."@en .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/mehme/ontologies/2026/superlig> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Süper Lig Football Knowledge Ontology"@en .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/mehme/ontologies/2026/superlig> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0" .
